      <data key="d1">"Antitrust lawsuit refers to potential legal challenges Nvidia could face due to its acquisition strategies, particularly regarding Groq."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2e470dedd05b45c97fe6e4fc7e8acb60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIGH-SPEED INTERCONNECT FABRIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"High-speed interconnect fabric is a technology used to connect multiple LPUs in Groq's architecture for enhanced performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2e470dedd05b45c97fe6e4fc7e8acb60</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;36 GB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL"</data>
